<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile sells zinc for avg $0.4950/lb.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile sells zinc for avg $0.4950/lb.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center said Tuesday it sold a total of 4,219,000 pounds of surplus zinc for an average $0.4950 per pound.</p>
